#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use an external eigensolver {#use-an-external-eigensolver}"
msgstr "Utiliser un eigensolver externe {#use-an-external-eigensolver}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use trim SQD with an external eigensolver by passing the `sci_solver` argument:\n"
msgstr "Tu peux utiliser trim SQD avec un eigensolver externe en passant l'argument `sci_solver` :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The prior snippet requires the `sbd-eigensolver` package to be installed from PyPI.\n"
msgstr "L'extrait précédent nécessite l'installation du package `sbd-eigensolver` depuis PyPI.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribute the work {#distribute-the-work}"
msgstr "Distribuer le travail {#distribute-the-work}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `TrimPolicy`, the loop calls `sci_solver` twice per iteration: once with all the batches, and once with the merged subspace. Both calls go through the ordinary `sci_solver` interface, which [this package's multi-process support](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/hpc-acceleration) invokes collectively on every MPI rank.\n"
msgstr "Avec `TrimPolicy`, la boucle appelle `sci_solver` deux fois par itération : une fois avec tous les lots, et une fois avec le sous-espace fusionné. Les deux appels passent par l'interface ordinaire de `sci_solver`, que [la prise en charge multiprocessus de ce package](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/hpc-acceleration) invoque collectivement sur chaque rang MPI.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two levels of parallelism are potentially available, and they are independent:\n"
msgstr "Deux niveaux de parallélisme sont potentiellement disponibles, et ils sont indépendants :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Within a diagonalization.** A solver such as SBD can spread a single diagonalization across ranks.\n"
msgstr "**Au sein d'une diagonalisation.** Un solveur tel que SBD peut répartir une seule diagonalisation entre plusieurs rangs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Across the batches.** A solver could, in principle, diagonalize the batches concurrently.\n"
msgstr "**Entre les lots.** Un solveur pourrait, en principe, diagonaliser les lots de façon concurrente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Given a set of batches, the solver determines how to delegate work to its worker processes.\n"
msgstr "Étant donné un ensemble de lots, le solveur détermine comment déléguer le travail à ses processus de travail.\n"
